@startuml voice_call_ai_sequence
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam shadowing false

box "External Gateway" #LightYellow
participant "Vobiz.ai\nTelephony Gateway" as Vobiz
end box

box "FastAPI Backend (src/)" #LightCyan
participant "CallStreamRoutes\n(routes/)" as Routes
participant "CallSessionService\n(service/)" as SessionService
participant "CallOrchestratorGraph\n(agents/)" as Orchestrator
participant "Tool Layer\n(tools/)" as Tools
participant "AudioStreamPipeline\n(service/)" as Pipe
end box

box "External APIs & DB" #LightPink
participant "Gemini API\n(client/)" as Gemini
participant "Inworld TTS\n(client/)" as TTS
database "PostgreSQL\n(database/)" as DB
end box

== Phase 1: Call Initialization & WebSocket Connection ==
Vobiz -> Routes: Establish WebSocket Stream (/api/v1/telephony/stream/{session_id})[cite: 11]
Routes -> SessionService: handle_session_stream(session_id, caller_number, websocket)
SessionService -> DB: Insert session state (call_sessions table)
DB --> SessionService: Acknowledge session active

== Phase 2: User Utterance & Turn Processing ==
Vobiz -> Routes: Send 8kHz PCM audio chunk / Speech payload
Routes -> SessionService: VAD processes audio frame (isolates speech turn > 600ms)
SessionService -> Orchestrator: process_turn(session_state, user_utterance)
Orchestrator -> Gemini: Evaluate intent & bind tools (Search / Maps / Transit / YouTube / Reminder)
Gemini --> Orchestrator: Return tool call payload or direct response text

alt Tool Execution (e.g., Search, Transit, or Reminder)
    Orchestrator -> Tools: Execute selected tool (e.g., search_tool / reminder_tool)
    Tools -> DB: Query or persist state if required
    DB --> Tools: Success / Dataset returned
    Tools --> Orchestrator: Tool results formatted
    Orchestrator -> Gemini: Synthesize final conversational answer
    Gemini --> Orchestrator: Natural text response (Tamil/English)
end

== Phase 3: Text-to-Speech & Audio Streaming ==
Orchestrator --> SessionService: Return response_text & citations
SessionService -> TTS: synthesize_stream(text, detected_language)
TTS --> SessionService: AsyncIterator[bytes] (8kHz PCM chunks)
SessionService -> Vobiz: Push audio frames over WebSocket to caller

== Phase 4: User Interruption (Barge-In) Handling ==
note over Vobiz, Pipe
  User speaks while music/news or assistant speech is actively playing.
end note
Vobiz -> Routes: Inbound speech energy exceeds VAD interruption threshold (> 200ms)
Routes -> SessionService: interrupt_active_playback(session_id)
SessionService -> Pipe: terminate_stream() [Stops ffmpeg / yt-dlp / TTS subprocesses immediately]
Pipe --> SessionService: Subprocesses killed (SIGTERM)
SessionService -> Vobiz: Send buffer-clear command frame
SessionService -> Orchestrator: Reset session state (playback_state = "idle", clear active stream)
note over SessionService, Orchestrator
  System captures the new user utterance as a fresh intent turn
  without requiring a call disconnect or reconnect.
end note

@enduml